df-about =
    Sken-d talɣut ɣef unagraw n ifuyla i deg yella yal AFAYLU,
    neɣ ɣef meṛṛa inagrawen n ifuyla s wudem amezwer.
df-usage = df [TAXTIṚT]... [AFAYLU]...
df-after-help =
    Azalen yettwaskanen llan s yiferdisen n TIDDI tamezwarut yellan seg --block-size,
    akked yimuttiyen n twennaḍt DF_BLOCK_SIZE, BLOCK_SIZE d BLOCKSIZE.
    Ma ulac, iferdisen imezwar llan d 1024 n yiṭamḍanen (neɣ 512 ma POSIXLY_CORRECT yettwasbadu).

    TIDDI d amḍan ummid akked uferdis axetṛan (amedya: 10M d 10*1024*1024).
    Iferdisen d K, M, G, T, P, E, Z, Y (tizmar n 1024) neɣ KB, MB,... (tizmar
    n 1000). Iferdisen zemren ad ilin d imrawanen, isḍismrawanen, itamḍanen neɣ imsinanen.
df-help-all = Seddu ula d inagrawen n ifuyla « dummy »
df-help-block-size = Selket tiddiwin ɣer yiferdisen n TIDDI uqbel ad tent-id-teskneḍ; amedya, '-BM' yeskan-d tiddiwin s yiferdisen n 1 048 576 n yiṭamḍanen
df-help-total = Fares aɣrud amatu
df-help-human-readable = Sken-d tiddiwin s umasal isehlen i tɣuri (amedya: 1K 234M 2G)
df-help-si = Akka daɣen, maca seqdec tizmar n 1000, mačči n 1024
